{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "group-canonical",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "CANONICAL ENTITIES (hco_schema_specification.md)",
      "x": -950,
      "y": -500,
      "width": 1150,
      "height": 980,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-hco-investigation",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Investigation (Canonical)\n* `investigation_id`: string\n* `title`: string\n* `psi_code`: string (e.g. \"PSI-69\")\n* `platform`: string (ISS CIR, MSG, Cygnus)\n* `chamber_hardware`: string\n* `doi`: string (peer-reviewed citation)",
      "x": -920,
      "y": -460,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 200
    },
    {
      "id": "node-hco-run",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### ExperimentalRun (Canonical)\n* `run_id`: string (official NASA flight test ID)\n* `investigation_id`: string\n* `conditions`: EnvironmentalConditions\n* `fuel`: FuelSpec",
      "x": -550,
      "y": -460,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 160
    },
    {
      "id": "node-hco-conditions",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### EnvironmentalConditions (Canonical)\n* `gravity_g`: number ($g/g_0$)\n* `pressure_kpa`: number\n* `oxygen_mole_fraction`: number\n* `flow_velocity_cm_s`: number\n* `diluent`: string (N2, CO2, He)\n* `external_radiant_flux_kw_m2`: optional number\n* `ambient_temp_k`: number",
      "x": -920,
      "y": -220,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 220
    },
    {
      "id": "node-hco-fuel",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### FuelSpec (Canonical)\n* `material_name`: string\n* `chemical_formula`: optional string\n* `phase`: solid | liquid | gaseous\n* `geometry_type`: droplet | slab | rod | fabric\n* `dimensions`: FuelDimensions\n* `thermally_thin`: boolean",
      "x": -550,
      "y": -260,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 200
    },
    {
      "id": "node-hco-finding",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### EmpiricalFinding (Canonical Unit)\n* `finding_id`: string\n* `investigation_id`: string\n* `run_id`: string\n* `claim_statement`: string\n* `phenomenon`: CombustionPhenomenon\n* `qualitative_trend`: increases | decreases | quenched\n* `quantitative_measurements`: MeasurementRecord[]\n* `evidence_strength`: definitive | moderate\n* `provenance`: AuditProvenance",
      "x": -180,
      "y": -460,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 260
    },
    {
      "id": "node-hco-measurement",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### MeasurementRecord (Canonical)\n* `metric_name`: string\n* `metric_symbol`: string ($V_f, d_{ext}, K$)\n* `value`: number\n* `unit`: string (SI normalized)\n* `uncertainty`: optional number\n* `measurement_method`: optical | thermocouple | radiometer",
      "x": -180,
      "y": -160,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 190
    },
    {
      "id": "node-hco-provenance",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### AuditProvenance (Canonical)\n* `psi_investigation_code`: string\n* `psi_run_id`: string\n* `raw_telemetry_file`: optional string\n* `video_frame_timestamp_s`: optional number\n* `peer_reviewed_doi`: string\n* `psi_direct_url`: string",
      "x": -180,
      "y": 80,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 190
    },
    {
      "id": "node-hco-chain",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### EvidenceChain (Canonical)\n* `chain_id`: string\n* `query_id`: string\n* `target_question`: string\n* `claim_summary`: string\n* `steps`: EvidenceChainStep[]",
      "x": -550,
      "y": 80,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 180
    },
    {
      "id": "group-proposed",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "PROPOSED SCHEMA REVISIONS (docs/hco_schema_change_proposal.md)",
      "x": 250,
      "y": -500,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 550,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-prop-scientific-value",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### ScientificValue<T> (Proposed)\n* `normalized_value`: T (SI units for engine search)\n* `normalized_unit`: string\n* `raw_value`: number | string | null (exact source reading)\n* `raw_unit`: string | null ($psia, in, ft/min$)\n* `uncertainty`: optional number | null\n* `source_column_header`: string (CSV column binding)",
      "x": 270,
      "y": -460,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 150
    },
    {
      "id": "node-prop-nullability",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Explicit Nullability & Zero-Fill Ban (Proposed)\n* `flow_velocity_cm_s`: ScientificValue | null (quiescent)\n* `external_radiant_flux`: ScientificValue | null (no heater)\n* `ambient_temp_k`: ScientificValue | null (uncalibrated)\n* **Rule**: Zero-fill substitution strictly prohibited.",
      "x": 270,
      "y": -290,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 110
    },
    {
      "id": "node-prop-verification-level",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### VerificationLevel Tag (Proposed)\n* `VERIFIED_EMPIRICAL` (audited vs PSI table & DOI)\n* `PARTIALLY_VERIFIED` (source real, run unlinked)\n* `PRELIMINARY_UNAUDITED` (ingested, pending audit)\n* `SYNTHETIC_ILLUSTRATIVE` (mock; excluded from retrieval)",
      "x": 270,
      "y": -160,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 110
    },
    {
      "id": "node-prop-typed-geometry",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Discriminated Fuel Geometries (Proposed)\n* `DropletGeometry`: initial_diameter, fiber_support_diameter\n* `FlatSampleGeometry`: thickness, width, length, areal_density\n* `CylindricalGeometry`: diameter, length, core_type",
      "x": 270,
      "y": -30,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 100
    },
    {
      "id": "group-open-questions",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "OPEN SCHEMA QUESTIONS (Decisions Pending Phase 1)",
      "x": 250,
      "y": 80,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 400,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-open-timeseries",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Open Q1: Telemetry Time-Series Storage\n* Should high-frequency sensor curves (e.g. $10\\text{ Hz}$ thermocouple rakes, optical $d^2(t)$ curves) be stored as relational time-series tables in Supabase, or referenced as external binary/Parquet links while storing only scalar summary endpoints in PostgreSQL?",
      "x": 270,
      "y": 120,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 150
    },
    {
      "id": "node-open-column-mapping",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Open Q2: Column Header Normalization Across Bundles\n* Ingestion parsers must handle differing header conventions across flight packages (e.g. `CHAMBER_PRESS_PSIA` in BASS-II vs `P_kPa` in Saffire). Decision needed on automated dictionary mapping versus per-investigation YAML configs.",
      "x": 270,
      "y": 290,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 160
    }
  ],
